  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Siha Kiyeyo Coffee Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Location: Siha District, Tanzania.Through this project, Siha Kiyeyo will improve its organizational capacity, have access to a revolving fund to purchase inputs and raw materials, establish coffee nurseries to improve the quantity and quality of coffee seedlings available to farmers, thereby increasing the incomes of both Siha Kiyeyo and its farmers members.</narrative>
  </description>
